   ========================================================================== */

/* --- Collapsed panels ------------------------------------------------------
   #menuContent is a grid with a definite block size on compact viewports. A
   grid item whose overflow is not visible gets an automatic minimum size of
   zero, so any panel that clips its own overflow could be squashed to padding
   height while its content still existed underneath. That is the reported
   "cards are not loading" failure: Training Squad, Team XP Benefits, the
   league table, squad dynamics, the calendar agenda, the loadout panel and the
   tactical analysis all rendered as empty boxes.

   Restoring a content-based minimum fixes every one of them at once. Measured
   by __strikeDebug.mobileInterfaceAuditForTest().collapsed.
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

#menuContent > * {
  min-height: max-content;
}

